menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_LOCAL_COMMAND
    bool "Enable offline local command macros"
    default y
    depends on FEATURE_CONFIG_STORE
    help
        Caches a bounded set of guardian-published trigger phrases that map to
        local device actions, so common commands keep working with no network.
        The device resolves phrases locally and never queues audio or child
        data.

endmenu
